	// - shadow → head: +1 line added (user after)
	// - accumulatedUserAdded: 2 (from PromptAttributions)
	// - totalAgentAdded: 12 - 2 = 10 (correctly separates user lines from agent work)
	// - totalUserAdded: 2 + 1 = 3
